OL,3,GNEWSAThe battle to end 'indignity' of
OL,4,Ahospital corridor care
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital corridors lined with patients
OL,7,Fon beds used to be a seasonal problem,
OL,8,Flinked to winter pressures such as flu.
OL,9,FIn recent years, though, such scenes
OL,10,Fhave become a year-round issue across
OL,11,Fthe UK.
OL,13,FIn Liverpool, nurses and doctors have
OL,14,Ftreated more than 24,000 people in
OL,15,Fcorridors over the past year, in what
OL,16,Fthe NHS describes as "clinically
OL,17,Finappropriate spaces".
OL,19,FIt says such care should happen only in
OL,20,F"exceptional circumstances".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
